sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Device
    participant Fleet as Monad Fleet service
    participant API as /events/{item}
    participant State as state.json

    Device->>Fleet: PublishEvent(COMMAND_STARTED, event_id, ...)
    Fleet->>State: lookup run key
    State-->>Fleet: not found
    Fleet->>API: POST /events/{item} (title, start, end, metadata)
    API-->>Fleet: 201 Created (Location: /event/{id})
    Fleet->>State: store run key -> event id + status
    Fleet-->>Device: Ack(ok=true, stored in event/{id})
